/target
*.wasm
.DS_Store

# Cargo.lock IS committed here, overriding the global ignore rule.
#
# OutLayer compiles this example inside the enclave and attests the hash of the resulting
# wasm. An unpinned dependency graph means the same source can compile to a different
# binary, and a measurement nobody can reproduce is not much of a measurement. It also keeps
# the build resolvable by the worker's compiler image, which is Rust 1.85.
!Cargo.lock
